{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50605","headline":"诗一首 · 独孤及","name":"诗一首","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"簿领日盈机，知君傲烦嚣。\n饮和自忘渴，况以初筵招。\n道契迹自亲，谁爲列宿遥。\n（谁爲，《文苑英华》卷七一○引此序作「谁谓」。\n）何用结同心，绿琴复长瓢。\n日月若走马，炎凉催斗杓。\n一年解颐笑，（解颐笑，《文苑英华》作「解大笑」。\n）几日如今宵。\n奉君千金寿，莫使岁寒凋。\n（案此诗载《全唐文》卷三百八十七独孤及《冬夜裴员外薛侍御置酒安集序》一文中。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"独孤及","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50605.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50605","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}